Z||000000||DISenchanted||01-23-2000||03:14 AM||||Ok, here's the deal.  I'm buying an 88gt from a guy that owns one of the Fiero rebody company's.  We're sitting there talking and I mention this forum.  He says what ever you think people will buy, we'll make.<P>So, now I need all of your help.  What are some modifications you guys would like to see?<P>Aside from Cup holders.  My design is almost finished.<P>If you can think of anything let me know.<P>DISenchanted||||reg||1
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||01-23-2000||03:43 AM||||I've mentioned this to Tom already, but the one mod I really want to see is IRM-style sidescoops. (the ones that replace the whole rocker panel and rear quarter panel.)<BR>they're $550 USD from IRM.. a bit much. I'd love to get a set of those once I get my GT. <P>a new front end would be nice too. I like the PISA ZR-2 front end.. think that was $1,500 or so.. maybe less. still out of my budget.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>oh yeah.. and I'll take one of those 7 of 9 fenders we were discussing last year too. rotfl..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
