Z||000005||lowCG||01-23-2000||10:02 AM||||How about a decent looking rebody from a reputable designer that isn't a shortened version of another design,or that doesn't look like kids made it?<BR>Or maybe some caliper brackets,and hoses for my super(off-the-shelf)brake parts I'm going to be using,that'd be nice.<BR>OK,a stainless header kit,complete with extensive heat shielding for the 3.4 4cam(Monte Carlo)motor?||||reg||1
