Z||000010||DISenchanted||01-24-2000||07:16 AM||||I'll look into the brake and turn signals.  I'll be putting new mirrors on the Fiero when I get it so I'd like some turn signals as well.<P>They already have an F-50 kit.  It bolts right on and it looks awesome.  I'll get some pictures from him.  As far as the price, I'm not quite sure what he's asking.<P>The hood louvers are a great idea.  Let me talk to him about the design.  As far as price, the more they make the cheaper it is.  If anyone else is interested let me know.<P>They do have a really nice Ferrari kit, I'm pretty sure that it's just bolt on but let me ask.<P>As far as the Headers I don't think that they do that kind of work.  Sorry.<P>DaRkLoRD:  I hear you about the IRM scoops, that was the first thing that I mentioned.  He loves the Idea and is alreay working on the prototype.  I'll let you know what happens.<P>Keep them comming.<P>DISenchanted<p>[This message has been edited by DISenchanted (edited 01-24-2000).]||||reg||1
