Z||000029||Earne||01-29-2000||11:32 AM||||Darklord,<P>A thinking business man, using every opportunity to identify his client's needs.  What is the name of the rebody company?<P>The hood scoop is a good idea, but a whole hood replacement is better.  Nothing worse then opening the hood and seeing the unfinished result of a "cut-in" job, points off.<P>The front end is most needed.  But most replace the fenders with the front end.  They forgot the panel concept.  Copies of some of the original concept Fieros would be great.  Many of these used the stock configuration with different nose coverings.  I can send pics if interested.||||reg||14
