Z||000031||DaRkLoRD||01-29-2000||02:48 PM||||Earne,<P>Just trying to be helpful to my friends on the forum.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>As to the name of the company, you'll have to ask DISenchanted.<P>I see what you mean about the scoop, I'm not sure how I'll finish off the underside of the decklid. DXR_DAD & Tom, any suggestions?<P>I'd love to get the ZR2 front end from PISA, but it's way out of my budget. That replaced the fenders as well I think.<P>Sure. I'd love to see some pics. I have 4 photos of the 89 Fiero prototype, as many forum members do, but if you have any other pics, please post them here, or email them to  <A HREF="mailto:steve@primeline.net">steve@primeline.net</A> <P>thanks!||||reg||1
